  {
   "cue": "a1_c001",
   "line": "a1_c001_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "品安！你的燈籠好漂亮。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.7,
   "voice_start_s": 3.826,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c001_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c001",
   "line": "a1_c001_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "我自己編的。你們在找什麼？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.26,
   "voice_start_s": 7.399,
   "diff_s": -0.139,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c001_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c001",
   "line": "a1_c001_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "主燈的骨架。它不見了！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 12.39,
   "voice_start_s": 12.529,
   "diff_s": -0.139,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c001_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c001",
   "line": "a1_c001_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "我也來布置！看我摺一盞燈籠——",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.41,
   "voice_start_s": 16.534,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c001_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c001",
   "line": "a1_c001_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "……你是青蛙燈嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 22.46,
   "voice_start_s": 22.604,
   "diff_s": -0.144,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c001_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c002",
   "line": "a1_c002_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "嘿，要不要看看這個？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 2.7,
   "voice_start_s": 2.83,
   "diff_s": -0.13,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c002_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c002",
   "line": "a1_c002_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "亮晶晶的，／聞起來香香的，很安全喔。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.34,
   "voice_start_s": 5.504,
   "diff_s": -0.164,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c002_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c002",
   "line": "a1_c002_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "哇……好亮。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 10.04,
   "voice_start_s": 10.215,
   "diff_s": -0.175,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c002_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c003",
   "line": "a1_c003_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "等一下，我想一想。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 0.9,
   "voice_start_s": 1.025,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c003_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c003",
   "line": "a1_c003_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "這盒子上面什麼都沒寫。／誰做的？裡面裝什麼？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.38,
   "voice_start_s": 3.513,
   "diff_s": -0.133,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c003_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c003",
   "line": "a1_c003_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "大家找找看，這個盒子哪裡怪怪的？／看到的舉手。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.7,
   "voice_start_s": 9.835,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c003_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c004",
   "line": "a1_c004_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "這是電子煙啦，大家都在玩。／試試看嘛。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.125,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c004_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c004",
   "line": "a1_c004_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "電子煙在臺灣是禁止的。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.72,
   "voice_start_s": 5.911,
   "diff_s": -0.191,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c004_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c004",
   "line": "a1_c004_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "包裝漂亮、聞起來香，／都不能證明安全。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.06,
   "voice_start_s": 9.256,
   "diff_s": -0.196,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c004_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c004",
   "line": "a1_c004_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "不用，我們不要。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.64,
   "voice_start_s": 13.77,
   "diff_s": -0.13,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c004_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c004",
   "line": "a1_c004_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "品安，快來，我們去跟阿樂叔叔說。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 18.8,
   "voice_start_s": 18.947,
   "diff_s": -0.147,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c004_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c004",
   "line": "a1_c004_06",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "你們先走，我把燈籠收好就來。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 22.91,
   "voice_start_s": 23.045,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c004_06_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c005",
   "line": "a1_c005_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第一題來囉！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.4,
   "voice_start_s": 1.524,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c005_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c005",
   "line": "a1_c005_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "有人拿出包裝漂亮的電子煙，／說「這個很安全」。可以相信嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 4.32,
   "voice_start_s": 4.457,
   "diff_s": -0.137,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c005_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c005",
   "line": "a1_c005_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "一，可以，包裝漂亮就很安全。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 11.38,
   "voice_start_s": 11.513,
   "diff_s": -0.133,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c005_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c005",
   "line": "a1_c005_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "二，不行，外觀不能證明安全。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 15.12,
   "voice_start_s": 15.247,
   "diff_s": -0.127,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c005_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c005",
   "line": "a1_c005_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "三，可以，聞起來香就沒問題。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 19.16,
   "voice_start_s": 19.282,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c005_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c006",
   "line": "a1_c006_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "正解是二：不行，／外觀不能證明安全。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.14,
   "diff_s": -0.14,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c006_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c007",
   "line": "a1_c007_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第一盞燈，亮了！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.9,
   "voice_start_s": 2.025,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c007_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c008",
   "line": "a1_c008_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "咦？／包裝裡面，怎麼有一團細細的線？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.2,
   "voice_start_s": 5.336,
   "diff_s": -0.136,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c008_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c008",
   "line": "a1_c008_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "不要碰。我們快去跟阿樂叔叔說。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.49,
   "voice_start_s": 9.634,
   "diff_s": -0.144,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c008_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a1_c008",
   "line": "a1_c008_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "阿樂叔叔？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 22.01,
   "voice_start_s": 22.135,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a1_c008_03_v04.wav"
  }
 ],
